Shinga icumu mu mashinga,&lt;br&gt;
Gaba intahe y'ubugabo ku bugingo.&lt;br&gt;
Warapfunywe ntiwapfuye,&lt;br&gt;
Warahabishijwe ntiwahababuka,&lt;br&gt;
Uhagurukana, uhagurukana, uhagurukana, ubugabo urikukira.&lt;br&gt;
Komerwamashyi n'amakungu,&lt;br&gt;
Habwa impundu nabawe,&lt;br&gt;
Isamirane mu mashinga, isamirane mu mashinga,
Burundi bwacu, ragi ry'abasokuru,&lt;br&gt;
Ramutswa intahe n'ibihugu,&lt;br&gt;
Ufatanije ishaka n'ubuhizi;&lt;br&gt;
Vuza impundu wiganzuye uwakuganza uwakuganza.
Burundi bwacu, nkoramutima kuri twese,&lt;br&gt;
Tugutuye amaboko, umitima n'ubuzima,&lt;br&gt;
Imana yakuduhaye ikudutungire.&lt;br&gt;
Horana ubumwe n'abagabo n'itekane.&lt;br&gt;
Sagwa n'urweze, sagwa n'amahoro meza.
